  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 grant-ubonshi youth empowerment project Central and Southern Provinces Phase 2 implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support is aimed at enhaning the funding provided to the two organisations providing bursary support to girls and vulnerable children.  The aim is to help the bursary receipients gain confidence, life skills, plans for life after school, sexual reproductive health rights and financial literacy.  This is meant to widen their understanding of the options available after school.</narrative>
